tlast\nCrysis 1-3\nEvil Within\nShadow Warrior 1 and 2\nSaints Row 2\nWitcher 1-3\nDoom\nQuantum Break\nPrototype\n\nPUT YOUR TIME INTO SOMETHING WORTH IT, WARFRAME IS NOT. \n\n-A man who foolishly wasted 2k hours in this game.", "timestamp_created": 1449527844, "timestamp_updated": 1589260781, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19554621", "author": {"steamid": "76561198161872972", "personaname": "Monster House MD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198161872972/", "num_games_owned": 81, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 113, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 99, "last_played": 1783831395, "avatar": "8e873d18e1e09f526d7b40e8d26fefcd3f0f7150"}, "language": "english", "review": "For anyone who likes the game, Destiny, I feel like you would love this game. It is extremely similar to it, but has a lot of better aspects to it then Destiny. Like Destiny, It has a raid, pvp, missions, and guns, but this game also has some unique aspects too. The raid is more envolved, and there is defintely more of a edge of your seat-type feel to it. Even without the expansion packs, it is still a great game.", "timestamp_created": 1449523567, "timestamp_updated": 1449523567, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490463227033615112", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19554391", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026253042", "personaname": "Soraku Fett", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamc